Package: textpatterns
Type: Package
Title: Descriptive Helpers for Relationship Texting Patterns
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("WhatHeThinks", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jiankn@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Small deterministic helpers for describing observable messaging patterns such as conversation initiation shares. The package intentionally separates measurement from interpretation.
